<rml>
<head>
	<link type="text/css" href="/ui/theme/theme.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="main">
	<div class="content">
		<p class="title">番组表</p>
		<p class="subtitle">本季放送中的番剧</p>

		<p class="loading" data-if="homeLoading">正在加载…</p>
		<p class="error" data-if="homeHasError">{{ homeError }}</p>
		<p class="muted">{{ homeStatus }}</p>

		<div class="card">
			<p class="card-title">列表绑定待接入</p>
			<p class="muted">登录、会话与 Tab 已接通；番组列表会在列表绑定完成后显示在这里。</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="tabbar">
		<div class="tab" data-class-active="tabHome" data-event-click="action('tab-home')">番组</div>
		<div class="tab" data-class-active="tabProfile" data-event-click="action('tab-profile')">我的</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
